# Rust / Tauri
src-tauri/target
# Regenerated by tauri::generate_context! on every build, and platform-specific
# (macOS-schema.json / linux-schema.json / windows-schema.json). Matches the
# official Tauri v2 template, which ignores /target and /gen/schemas only.
src-tauri/gen/schemas
# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored: this is an application, not a library,
# so it is committed for reproducible builds (per the Cargo FAQ — `cargo new`
# tracks it by default). It matters here in particular because rdkafka-sys is
# pinned to a git rev of a fork; without the lock file that dependency is not
# reproducible.

# Logs
*.log
